    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96007" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σποδ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roast</i> or <i>bake in ashes</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρτα καὶ φηγοὺς πρὸς τὸ πῦρ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				372c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤ με κεραυνῷ . . σπόδισον</span>
			<i>burn</i> me <i>to ashes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				329
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὰς τρίχας</span>
			<i>singe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>to be ash-coloured</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.152
			</span></i>. </div>
